msgid "Design not specified: treated as independent groups. Set design='paired' for repeated measurements on the same subjects."
msgstr "デザイン未指定のため独立群として扱いました。同じ対象者の反復測定なら「対応あり」を指定してください。"

msgid "Measurement scale not specified: treated as continuous."
msgstr "尺度未指定のため連続変数として扱いました。"

msgid "%s incomplete pair(s) removed (a value was missing or not a number)."
msgstr "不完全なペアを %s 組除外しました（欠損または数値でない値）。"

msgid "%s: %s missing or non-numeric value(s) removed."
msgstr "%s：欠損または数値でない値を %s 個除外しました。"

msgid "%s: too few values for Shapiro–Wilk (n = %s)"
msgstr "%s：Shapiro–Wilk 検定には値が少なすぎます（n = %s）"

msgid "%s: all values are identical; normality cannot be assessed"
msgstr "%s：すべて同じ値のため正規性を評価できません"

msgid "%s: Shapiro–Wilk has low power at n = %s; a non-significant result does not show normality"
msgstr "%s：n = %s では Shapiro–Wilk 検定の検出力が低く、有意でなくても正規性の証明にはなりません"

msgid "%s: Shapiro–Wilk is oversensitive at n = %s; trivial departures reach significance"
msgstr "%s：n = %s では Shapiro–Wilk 検定が過敏で、わずかな逸脱でも有意になります"

msgid "Scale: %s"
msgstr "尺度：%s"

msgid "Needs a contingency table of counts; the data are %s"
msgstr "度数の分割表が必要です（データは%s）"

msgid "Needs continuous data; the data are %s"
msgstr "連続データが必要です（データは%s）"

msgid "Needs continuous or ordinal data; the data are %s"
msgstr "連続または順序データが必要です（データは%s）"

msgid "Needs independent observations; paired counts need McNemar's test (not covered here)"
msgstr "独立な観測が必要です。対応のある度数には McNemar 検定が必要です（ここでは対象外）"

msgid "Independent groups"
msgstr "独立した群"

msgid "Paired (repeated) measurements"
msgstr "対応のある（反復）測定"

msgid "Needs independent groups; the design is paired"
msgstr "独立した群が必要です（デザインは対応あり）"

msgid "Needs paired measurements; the design is independent"
msgstr "対応のある測定が必要です（デザインは独立）"

msgid "Needs a table with at least 2 rows and 2 columns; the table is %s × %s"
msgstr "2行2列以上の表が必要です（表は %s × %s）"

msgid "Needs a 2 × 2 table; the table is %s × %s"
msgstr "2 × 2 の表が必要です（表は %s × %s）"

msgid "Table: %s × %s"
msgstr "表：%s × %s"

msgid "Needs exactly 2 groups; there are %s"
msgstr "ちょうど2群が必要です（%s 群あります）"

msgid "Needs 3 or more groups; there are %s"
msgstr "3群以上が必要です（%s 群あります）"

msgid "Groups: %s"
msgstr "群の数：%s"

msgid "Each group needs n ≥ %s; the smallest n = %s"
msgstr "各群に n ≥ %s が必要です（最小 n = %s）"

msgid "Paired groups must have the same length (%s)"
msgstr "対応のある群は同じ長さが必要です（%s）"

msgid "No normality assumption (rank-based)"
msgstr "正規性を仮定しません（順位に基づく）"

msgid "Normality not rejected (Shapiro–Wilk p ≥ %s, %s)"
msgstr "正規性は棄却されません（Shapiro–Wilk p ≥ %s、%s）"

msgid "Normality rejected (Shapiro–Wilk p < %s in %s)"
msgstr "正規性が棄却されました（Shapiro–Wilk p < %s：%s）"

msgid "Normality cannot be assessed (fewer than 3 values or constant values)"
msgstr "正規性を評価できません（値が3個未満、または一定）"

msgid "Does not assume equal variances"
msgstr "等分散を仮定しません"

msgid "Spreads differ (Brown–Forsythe p %s): read the result as stochastic dominance, not a shift in location"
msgstr "ばらつきが異なります（Brown–Forsythe p %s）。結果は位置のずれではなく確率的優越として解釈してください"

msgid "Equal variances not rejected (Brown–Forsythe p %s)"
msgstr "等分散は棄却されません（Brown–Forsythe p %s）"

msgid "Variances differ (Brown–Forsythe p %s)"
msgstr "分散が異なります（Brown–Forsythe p %s）"

msgid "Equal variances cannot be assessed"
msgstr "等分散性を評価できません"

msgid "All expected counts ≥ %s (minimum %s)"
msgstr "すべての期待度数が %s 以上です（最小 %s）"

msgid "Expected count below %s in %s of %s cells (minimum %s)"
msgstr "期待度数が %s 未満のセルが %s / %s 個あります（最小 %s）"

msgid "Expected counts cannot be computed (a row or column total is zero)"
msgstr "期待度数を計算できません（行または列の合計が0）"

msgid "Exact test: valid at any expected count"
msgstr "正確検定：期待度数によらず有効"

msgid "All paired differences are zero"
msgstr "対応のある差がすべて0です"

msgid "The groups do not overlap: the Brunner–Munzel variance estimate is zero, so the test is undefined"
msgstr "群が重なっていないため Brunner–Munzel の分散推定値が0になり、検定が定義できません"

msgid "Small samples (n < %s): the Brunner–Munzel approximation is less accurate"
msgstr "小標本（n < %s）では Brunner–Munzel の近似の精度が下がります"

msgid "Sphericity is checked when the test runs (Greenhouse–Geisser correction if violated)"
msgstr "球面性は検定実行時に確認します（満たさなければ Greenhouse–Geisser 補正）"

msgid "Groups have equal length: if these are repeated measurements on the same subjects, set the design to paired."
msgstr "群の長さが同じです。同じ対象者の反復測定なら、デザインを「対応あり」にしてください。"

msgid "Contingency table (%s × %s)"
msgstr "分割表（%s × %s）"

msgid "Paired counts need McNemar's test, which this recommender does not cover"
msgstr "対応のある度数には McNemar 検定が必要ですが、この推奨機能の対象外です"

msgid "All expected counts ≥ %s"
msgstr "すべての期待度数が %s 以上"

msgid "Expected count below %s in %s of %s cells"
msgstr "期待度数が %s 未満のセルが %s / %s 個"

msgid "No exact test for tables larger than 2 × 2 here: combine categories or collect more data"
msgstr "2 × 2 より大きい表の正確検定はありません。カテゴリを統合するか、データを増やしてください"

msgid "At least 2 groups are needed to compare"
msgstr "比較には2群以上が必要です"

msgid "Each group needs n ≥ %s"
msgstr "各群に n ≥ %s が必要です"

msgid "Design not specified: treated as independent groups"
msgstr "デザイン未指定：独立群として扱いました"

msgid "Ordinal data: rank-based test"
msgstr "順序データ：順位に基づく検定"

msgid "Normality not rejected (Shapiro–Wilk, %s)"
msgstr "正規性は棄却されません（Shapiro–Wilk、%s）"

msgid "Normality rejected (Shapiro–Wilk) in %s"
msgstr "正規性が棄却されました（Shapiro–Wilk）：%s"

msgid "Normality cannot be assessed: rank-based test"
msgstr "正規性を評価できないため順位に基づく検定"

msgid "Equal variances declared in advance (documented reason)"
msgstr "等分散を事前に宣言（根拠あり）"

msgid "Default: Welch's t-test (no documented reason to assume equal variances)"
msgstr "既定：Welch の t 検定（等分散を仮定する根拠がないため）"

msgid "Internal check: %s is not applicable"
msgstr "内部チェック：%s は適用できません"

msgid "Primary test: %s"
msgstr "主検定：%s"

msgid "Brunner–Munzel is undefined for these data (the groups do not overlap): Mann–Whitney U instead"
msgstr "このデータでは Brunner–Munzel が定義できない（群が重ならない）ため Mann–Whitney U を使用"

msgid "Welch's t-test compares two independent means without assuming equal variances. It is the default over Student's t-test: it loses little power when variances are equal and keeps the false-positive rate when they are not."
msgstr "Welch の t 検定は等分散を仮定せずに独立2群の平均を比較します。等分散のときも検出力の損失はわずかで、不等分散のときは偽陽性率を保つため、Student の t 検定より優先する既定です。"

msgid "Student's t-test was chosen because equal variances were declared in advance (a documented reason) and are not rejected by the data."
msgstr "等分散が事前に宣言され（根拠あり）、データでも棄却されないため Student の t 検定を選びました。"

msgid "The Mann–Whitney U test compares two independent groups by ranks, so it does not rely on normality."
msgstr "Mann–Whitney U 検定は独立2群を順位で比較するため、正規性に依存しません。"

msgid "The Brunner–Munzel test compares two independent groups by ranks without assuming equal spreads, which differ here."
msgstr "Brunner–Munzel 検定は等しいばらつきを仮定せずに独立2群を順位で比較します。このデータではばらつきが異なります。"

msgid "The paired t-test compares two related measurements; the paired differences are consistent with normality."
msgstr "対応のある t 検定は関連する2測定を比較します。差は正規性と矛盾しません。"

msgid "The Wilcoxon signed-rank test compares two related measurements by ranks, so it does not rely on normal differences."
msgstr "Wilcoxon 符号付順位検定は関連する2測定を順位で比較するため、差の正規性に依存しません。"

msgid "One-way ANOVA compares three or more independent means; normality and equal variances are not rejected."
msgstr "一元配置分散分析は独立した3群以上の平均を比較します。正規性・等分散性は棄却されません。"

msgid "Welch's ANOVA compares three or more independent means without assuming equal variances, which differ here."
msgstr "Welch の分散分析は等分散を仮定せずに独立した3群以上の平均を比較します。このデータでは分散が異なります。"

msgid "The Kruskal–Wallis H test compares three or more independent groups by ranks, so it does not rely on normality."
msgstr "Kruskal–Wallis H 検定は独立した3群以上を順位で比較するため、正規性に依存しません。"

msgid "Repeated-measures ANOVA compares three or more related conditions; the residuals are consistent with normality."
msgstr "反復測定分散分析は関連する3条件以上を比較します。残差は正規性と矛盾しません。"

msgid "The Friedman test compares three or more related conditions by ranks, so it does not rely on normality."
msgstr "Friedman 検定は関連する3条件以上を順位で比較するため、正規性に依存しません。"

msgid "The chi-square test of independence applies because every expected count is at least 5."
msgstr "すべての期待度数が5以上なので、カイ二乗独立性検定を適用できます。"

msgid "Fisher's exact test is used because some expected counts are below 5, where the chi-square approximation is unreliable."
msgstr "期待度数が5未満のセルがあり、カイ二乗近似が信頼できないため Fisher の正確検定を用います。"

msgid "Assumes equal variances; use only with a documented reason stated before seeing the data."
msgstr "等分散を仮定します。データを見る前に示した根拠がある場合のみ使用してください。"

msgid "Does not assume equal variances; a natural sensitivity analysis."
msgstr "等分散を仮定しません。感度分析として自然です。"

msgid "Rank-based: less power when normality holds, and it tests stochastic ordering rather than means."
msgstr "順位に基づく：正規性が成り立つと検出力が低く、平均ではなく確率的順序を検定します。"

msgid "Rank-based and robust to unequal spreads, but it tests P(X < Y) = 0.5 rather than means."
msgstr "順位に基づきばらつきの違いに頑健ですが、平均ではなく P(X < Y) = 0.5 を検定します。"

msgid "Preferred when spreads differ; here they do not, or the samples are too small for its approximation."
msgstr "ばらつきが異なる場合に推奨されますが、このデータでは異ならないか、近似には標本が小さすぎます。"

msgid "Assumes equal spreads under the null hypothesis; the spreads differ here."
msgstr "帰無仮説のもとで等しいばらつきを仮定しますが、このデータではばらつきが異なります。"

msgid "Rank-based: less power when the differences are normal."
msgstr "順位に基づく：差が正規分布なら検出力が低くなります。"

msgid "Does not assume equal variances; slightly less power when they are equal. A natural sensitivity analysis."
msgstr "等分散を仮定しません。等分散なら検出力がわずかに低下します。感度分析として自然です。"

msgid "Rank-based: less power when normality holds."
msgstr "順位に基づく：正規性が成り立つと検出力が低くなります。"

msgid "Rank-based: less power when the residuals are normal."
msgstr "順位に基づく：残差が正規分布なら検出力が低くなります。"

msgid "Exact and always valid, but conservative; not needed when every expected count is at least 5."
msgstr "正確で常に有効ですが保守的です。期待度数がすべて5以上なら不要です。"

msgid "Applicable, but not the pre-specified choice for this design."
msgstr "適用できますが、このデザインで事前に定めた選択ではありません。"

msgid "Sensitivity analyses only. The primary test was fixed before any p-value was seen. Choosing a test after seeing several p-values (for example, the smallest) inflates the false-positive rate; this is p-hacking. Report the primary test as the result and the others as sensitivity analyses."
msgstr "感度分析のみです。主検定は p 値を見る前に固定されています。複数の p 値を見てから検定を選ぶ（例：最小のものを選ぶ）と偽陽性率が上昇します。これは p ハッキングです。主検定を結果として報告し、その他は感度分析として報告してください。"

msgid "No test produced a p-value."
msgstr "p 値を出した検定はありません。"

msgid "Only one applicable test; there is nothing to compare."
msgstr "適用できる検定が1つだけなので、比較対象がありません。"

msgid "The tests disagree at α = %s (%s of %s significant). Report the primary test; the disagreement is itself a finding worth reporting."
msgstr "α = %s で検定結果が一致しません（%s / %s が有意）。主検定を報告してください。不一致自体も報告に値する所見です。"

msgid "All %s tests agree at α = %s (%s)."
msgstr "%s 個の検定すべてが α = %s で一致しています（%s）。"

msgid "Welch's t-test"
msgstr "Welch の t 検定"

msgid "Student's t-test"
msgstr "Student の t 検定"

msgid "Mann–Whitney U test"
msgstr "Mann–Whitney U 検定"

msgid "Brunner–Munzel test"
msgstr "Brunner–Munzel 検定"

