msgstr "対応のある t 検定"

msgid "Wilcoxon signed-rank test"
msgstr "Wilcoxon 符号付順位検定"

msgid "Welch's ANOVA"
msgstr "Welch の分散分析"

msgid "One-way ANOVA"
msgstr "一元配置分散分析"

msgid "Kruskal–Wallis H test"
msgstr "Kruskal–Wallis H 検定"

msgid "Repeated-measures ANOVA"
msgstr "反復測定分散分析"

msgid "Friedman test"
msgstr "Friedman 検定"

msgid "Chi-square test of independence"
msgstr "カイ二乗独立性検定"

msgid "Fisher's exact test"
msgstr "Fisher の正確検定"

msgid "continuous"
msgstr "連続"

msgid "ordinal"
msgstr "順序"

msgid "categorical"
msgstr "カテゴリ"

msgid "each group"
msgstr "各群"

msgid "paired differences"
msgstr "対応のある差"

msgid "residuals (subject + condition)"
msgstr "残差（対象者＋条件）"

msgid "differences"
msgstr "差"

msgid "residuals"
msgstr "残差"

msgid "Applicable"
msgstr "適用可"

msgid "Not applicable"
msgstr "適用不可"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推奨"

msgid "No test can be recommended for these data."
msgstr "このデータに推奨できる検定はありません。"

msgid "Recommended primary test"
msgstr "推奨する主検定"

msgid "Decision path"
msgstr "判断の経路"

msgid "Alternatives (%s), secondary"
msgstr "代替の検定（%s）：副次的"

msgid "Sensitivity analyses"
msgstr "感度分析"

msgid "Role"
msgstr "役割"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "検定"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "結果"

msgid "Primary (pre-specified)"
msgstr "主検定（事前指定）"

msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "感度分析"

msgid "Assumption tests are diagnostic, not confirmatory: they are not corrected for multiplicity, have low power in small samples and flag trivial departures in large ones. Check the Q-Q plots and spreads visually as well."
msgstr "前提の検定は診断用で、確証的なものではありません。多重性の補正はしておらず、小標本では検出力が低く、大標本ではわずかな逸脱でも有意になります。Q-Q プロットとばらつきも目で確認してください。"

msgid "Welch's correction is used by default whether or not the equal-variance test is significant; that test is reported, not used to switch tests. The classic equal-variance test is chosen only with a reason documented in advance."
msgstr "等分散性の検定が有意かどうかにかかわらず、既定で Welch の補正を用います。その検定結果は報告のみで、検定の切り替えには使いません。等分散を仮定する従来の検定は、事前に根拠を示した場合のみ選びます。"

msgid "p ≥ %s: normality not rejected"
msgstr "p ≥ %s：正規性は棄却されない"

msgid "p ≥ %s: equal variances not rejected"
msgstr "p ≥ %s：等分散は棄却されない"

msgid "Reported only (mean-centred; less robust to non-normality)"
msgstr "報告のみ（平均中心。非正規性に弱い）"

msgid "Descriptive; no significance test"
msgstr "記述統計のみ（有意性検定なし）"

msgid "≥ %s in every cell (%s of %s cells below)"
msgstr "全セルで %s 以上（下回るセル %s / %s）"

msgid "Shapiro–Wilk"
msgstr "Shapiro–Wilk"

msgid "Brown–Forsythe"
msgstr "Brown–Forsythe"

msgid "Levene"
msgstr "Levene"

msgid "Largest / smallest variance"
msgstr "最大分散 / 最小分散"

msgid "Minimum expected count"
msgstr "最小期待度数"

msgid "all groups"
msgstr "全群"

msgid "all cells"
msgstr "全セル"

msgid "not rejected"
msgstr "棄却されない"

msgid "rejected"
msgstr "棄却"

msgid "not assessable"
msgstr "評価不能"

msgid "reported"
msgstr "報告のみ"

msgid "met"
msgstr "満たす"

msgid "not met"
msgstr "満たさない"

msgid "Default: Welch's ANOVA (no documented reason to assume equal variances)"
msgstr "既定：Welch の分散分析（等分散を仮定する根拠がないため）"

msgid "One-way ANOVA was chosen because equal variances were declared in advance (a documented reason) and are not rejected by the data."
msgstr "等分散が事前に宣言され（根拠あり）、データでも棄却されないため一元配置分散分析を選びました。"

msgid "Welch's ANOVA compares three or more independent means without assuming equal variances. It is the default over one-way ANOVA: it loses little power when variances are equal and keeps the false-positive rate when they are not."
msgstr "Welch の分散分析は等分散を仮定せずに独立した3群以上の平均を比較します。等分散のときも検出力の損失はわずかで、不等分散のときは偽陽性率を保つため、一元配置分散分析より優先する既定です。"

msgid "Assumption checks"
msgstr "前提条件のチェック"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "チェック"

msgid "Sample"
msgstr "対象"

msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "基準"

msgid "Decision"
msgstr "判定"

msgid "Normal Q-Q plot: %s"
msgstr "正規 Q-Q プロット：%s"
